# One RapidAPI key for ExerciseDB and for related YouTube videos (channel/search; nothing is downloaded).
# 1) ExerciseDB: https://rapidapi.com/justin-WFnsXH_t6/api/exercisedb — Subscribe, then copy key.
# 2) Related videos: subscribe to youtube-search-and-download.p.rapidapi.com, use the same key here.
# Optional: YouTube channel to search within (default used if not set).
# Copy this file to .env and set your key. Restart the dev server after changing.
REACT_APP_RAPIDAPI_KEY=your_rapidapi_key_here
# REACT_APP_YOUTUBE_CHANNEL_ID=UChPvQ8hfrSW1EAbtBWjis0g
